0..76 Comment "/// An indexed family `Skip` carries an operation `skip` and a rule over it."
77..80 Comment "///"
81..160 Comment "/// Each node of the operation and the rule answers at its own span. The editor"
161..233 Comment "/// reads an indexed family\'s members as it reads an unindexed family\'s."
234..237 Comment "///"
238..314 Comment "/// The checker admits `Skip`, and the operation routes no function, since a"
315..394 Comment "/// route\'s port is a family at no index. The described reading gives each port"
395..473 Comment "/// the family at the index the port writes. The family states no expectation,"
474..529 Comment "/// since the sugared form drops an own-line attribute."
530..533 Comment "///"
534..579 Comment "/// - see: `corpus/model/data/map-laws.gandr`"
